## Step 6: Real-Time Safety Verification

After implementation, verify:

```cpp
// Scan for these patterns (FORBIDDEN in processBlock):
new / delete          // ❌ Allocation
malloc / free         // ❌ Allocation  
std::mutex::lock()    // ❌ May block
std::string           // ❌ May allocate
std::vector::push_back() // ❌ May allocate

// Use these instead:
std::atomic<float>   // ✅ Lock-free
SmoothedValue         // ✅ Pre-allocated
Pre-allocated buffers // ✅ In prepareToPlay()
```

