## Common Pitfalls

| Issue | Cause | Fix |
|-------|-------|-----|
| Click on param change | No smoothing | Add SmoothedValue |
| Effect not audible | Gain staging issue | Audit gain at each stage |
| CPU spike | Allocation in processBlock | Pre-allocate in prepareToPlay() |
| Random crash | Static state | Convert to per-instance members |

